OL,5,G1820 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe first visit is to Harrogate,
OL,7,     Fwhere management team Chris and
OL,8,     FKatie help to run the 64-bedroom
OL,9,     FWhite Hart Hotel. The extra charge
OL,10,     Ffor posh coffee at breakfast
OL,11,     Fcauses a stir.
OL,12,G1855 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe second visit is to Raouf and
OL,14,     Fhis friend Chrissie at the New
OL,15,     FPromenade Hotel in Blackpool.
OL,16,     FThere's a teetering toilet seat,
OL,17,     Fand Clarkey and Katie are turned
OL,18,     Foff by muck on the taps.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/6
