OL,5,G1925 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FVicky welcomes her rivals to her
OL,7,     Faptly named terrace house, The
OL,8,     FTerrace, in Oxford. Two pairs of
OL,9,     Fguests make some grim discoveries,
OL,10,     Fincluding hairs and a pre-sucked
OL,11,     Fsweet.
OL,12,G1955 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe final visit is to Robin and
OL,14,     FLiza's Georgian mansion, Tall
OL,15,     FJohn's House, in the Brecon
OL,16,     FBeacons. The guests gush over
OL,17,     Ftheir new friendships, but Vicky
OL,18,     Fdoesn't seem to share the
OL,19,     Fsentiment.
