OL,5,G2200 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FThe medical team, patients and
OL,7,     Ftheir families face the meaning of
OL,8,     Flife and death. One patient,
OL,9,     F77-year-old John, faces a
OL,10,     Fdangerous operation for a
OL,11,     Fpotentially deadly aneurysm.
OL,12,G2305 The Emergency Ward
OL,13,     FThe series with unprecedented
OL,14,     Faccess to Royal Melbourne
OL,15,     FHospital's major trauma centre.
OL,16,     FDoctors treat a pregnant woman
OL,17,     Fwho's been badly injured in a
OL,18,     Fhigh-speed car crash.
